    "body": "<p>Entry rules: <a href='https://embassyofuruguay.us/miami/index.php/es/visa-de-turismo/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Embassy of Uruguay in the US</a>. Health: <a href='https://wwwnc.cdc.gov/travel/destinations/traveler/none/uruguay' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>CDC Uruguay traveler page</a>. Transit fares/schedules: <a href='https://www.cot.com.uy/horarios-tarifas.php' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>COT</a>.</p><p>Sights: <a href='https://redtickets.uy/evento/Visitas-guiadas-al-Palacio-Salvo/19397/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Palacio Salvo guided tours (Red Ticket)</a>, <a href='https://visitacolonia.com/listings/visitas-al-faro-de-colonia/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Faro de Colonia</a>, <a href='http://www.museos.gub.uy/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Museo del Carnaval / Dirección Nacional de Cultura</a>, <a href='https://casapueblo.com.uy/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Casapueblo</a>, <a href='https://www.isladelobos.com.uy/en/home-english/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Isla de Lobos</a>.</p><p>Food: <a href='https://www.elpalenque.com.uy/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>El Palenque</a>, <a href='https://bodegabouza.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Bodega Bouza</a>. Carnival: <a href='https://eventos.montevideo.gub.uy/evento/desfiles-de-carnaval/desfile-de-llamadas' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Desfile de Llamadas (Intendencia de Montevideo)</a> — check for the 2027 dates closer to the trip; they were not yet posted as of this research pass.</p>"
